# HuggingFace `datasets` map-cache files. When a stage does
# `load_from_disk(<previous stage out>)` followed by `.map(...)`, datasets
# writes `cache-<hash>.arrow` files INTO the loaded dataset's directory --
# i.e. into the upstream stage's DVC-tracked output dir. They are incidental
# (regenerated each run, content varies) and must not contribute to the output
# hash, or `dvc status`/`dvc repro` would never be a clean no-op across stages
# or machines.
cache-*.arrow
